            <div xml:id="d195">

                <pb facs="0254" n="152" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg152"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/443: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at La Paz</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hazeltine</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">Temporarily at Iquique, to the
                        Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Iquique</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-02-26T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 26,
                                1919, 3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.59
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Conditions improved since my January 24, 3 p.m. Exodus continues but much reduced
                    and mob violence has not occurred. I am informed that local authorities suspect
                    purposes my commission. Please instruct.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hazeltine</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
